<title>AUSTRIA: EA-Generali stays welcome partner - Bank Austria.</title>
<headline>EA-Generali stays welcome partner - Bank Austria.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria said on Sunday insurer EA-Generali, which headed an international group that lost out to Bank Austria in the takeover of Creditanstalt, would remain a welcome partner.</p>
<p>Austro-Italian EA-Generali at present distributes insurance policies through Creditanstalt.</p>
<p>Bank Austria chief executive Gerhard Randa told a news conference that EA-Generali &quot;will remain a very welcome partner&quot; for the insurer's products following the Bank Austria/Creditanstalt merger. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 253</p>
</text>
